/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 204 0 R
/T (IoT networks generate heterogeneous observationsfrom authentication services, messaging protocols, web interfaces and device telemetry. A defensive analyst must distinguish normal activity from repeated access attempts, unauthorized publishing and movement between hosts. A collection of independent log entries cannot by itself communicate the sequence of a developing attack. The database must preserve both observations and relationships while enabling timely searches. )
/E (IoT networks generate heterogeneous observationsfrom authentication services, messaging protocols, web interfaces and device telemetry. A defensive analyst must distinguish normal activity from repeated access attempts, unauthorized publishing and movement between hosts. A collection of independent log entries cannot by itself communicate the sequence of a developing attack. The database must preserve both observations and relationships while enabling timely searches. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
386 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 204 0 R
/T (HoneyGraph organizes this information as devices, events, rules, alerts, incidents and derived risk. Its simulator creates approximately 500 virtual devices around Bengaluru. Normal traffic and seven abstract scenarios provide controlled examples for evaluating ingestion, detection, correlation and integrity. Source addresses use private networks or documentation ranges, and scenarios remain event records rather than attack tools. )
/E (HoneyGraph organizes this information as devices, events, rules, alerts, incidents and derived risk. Its simulator creates approximately 500 virtual devices around Bengaluru. Normal traffic and seven abstract scenarios provide controlled examples for evaluating ingestion, detection, correlation and integrity. Source addresses use private networks or documentation ranges, and scenarios remain event records rather than attack tools. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [8]
>>
