/T (Per-device hash chains make evidence modification observable without imposing a global ordering point. The React interface presents live alerts, incident graphs, risk maps and integrity results. Analysts inspect evidence and update incident status; administrators additionally manage rules, scenarios and accounts. These functions expose database concepts through a coherent defensive workflow. )
