/T (Separating inventory from events avoids repeating firmware and type in every observation. Separating users and rules prevents unrelated account changes from rewriting evidence. These choices reduce update anomalies in a manner analogous to normalization. However, protocol payloads, evidence ID arrays, incident chains and history remain embedded. The design does not claim every document satisfies relational 1NF, 2NF or 3NF. )
