1599 0 obj
<<
/Title (The proposed system combines a three-member MongoDB replica set, a Python FastAPI backend and a React dashboard. Events are retained in a regular collection and protected by per-device SHA-256 hash chains. Detection rules are stored as aggregation pipelines and refreshed through change streams. Alerts are correlated using bounded graph traversal; incidents, alert links and device risk scores are persisted within a multi-document transaction. Time-series telemetry rollups, geospatial searches, role-based access control and an authenticated WebSocket feed support operational investigation.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1575 0 R
/Prev 1586 0 R
/Next 1587 0 R
>>
endobj
