/Title (Scenario selection accepts seven defined names and an integer seed. Jobs may be launched, listed and stopped. User creation requires a username of at least three characters, a password of at least eight characters and an analyst or admin role. Administrators cannot deactivate their own account. Job coordination is process-local rather than a durable distributed queue.)
/Dest [28 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1589 0 R
