/Title (The implementation integrates change-stream detection, runtime aggregation rules, graph correlation and transaction-backed incident materialization. Per-device hash chains provide tamper evidence without a global ordering bottleneck. Separate time-series rollups preserve the regular events collection needed for change streams. The dashboard connects these database functions to alert inspection, ordered evidence, geospatial risk and integrity demonstrations.)
