/Title (Verification supports these behaviors with explicit limits. The Phase 9 record documents 304 ms live delivery, runtime rule creation, ordered four-hop evidence, role restrictions and status history. Saved bulk benchmarks report 33,251.4 events/s without chaining and 19,592.4 events/s with chaining using direct writes in an isolated corpus, not the validated HTTP path. Perfect reported quality scores come from a simplified evaluator with false positives fixed at zero; the failover script checks post-election ingestion rather than proving no alert loss. Stronger independent validation is needed before broader claims are made.)
