/Title (Performance is evaluated separately for database bulk insertion, indexed retrieval, detector latency and integrity checking. The saved benchmark corpus contains one million records per ingestion mode; direct-insert rates are not equivalent to HTTP API throughput. The historical browser gate measured 304 ms live alert delivery. These observations describe the tested environment rather than a guaranteed service-level objective.)
